<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#F6F5F1;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:40px 16px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:560px;">
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 20px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.02em;color:#15151A;">Prismatica</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DCDAD2;border-radius:6px;padding:32px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#15151A;">
<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:600;color:#15151A;">Sign-in request</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#15151A;">Someone entered the password of the Prismatica account ines@arlet.test and is waiting for your approval.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#15151A;">Time: Saturday, 17 October 2026 at 12:00:00 UTC<br>Browser and system: Mozilla/5.0 (X11 Linux x86_64) Firefox/131.0<br>Network address: 203.0.113.7<br>Place: Unknown location</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:600;color:#15151A;">Approve only if you are signing in right now and can see the 2-digit number on that screen. Never approve a sign-in you did not start.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#B93A0C" style="border-radius:4px;background-color:#B93A0C;"><a href="https://prismatica.example/auth/approve#t=abcDEF123_-abcDEF123_-abcDEF123_-abcDEF123_-" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.25;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;">Review this sign-in</a></td></tr></table>
<p style="margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#56565F;">The page asks you to type the number before anything is approved. The request expires in 60 minutes.</p>
<p style="margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#56565F;">If the button does not work, paste this address into your browser:<br><a href="https://prismatica.example/auth/approve#t=abcDEF123_-abcDEF123_-abcDEF123_-abcDEF123_-" style="color:#B93A0C;word-break:break-all;">https://prismatica.example/auth/approve#t=abcDEF123_-abcDEF123_-abcDEF123_-abcDEF123_-</a></p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:20px 0 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#56565F;">This was not you? Do not tap the button; the request expires on its own. Consider changing your password. Sent by <a href="https://prismatica.example" style="color:#56565F;">Prismatica</a> to ines@arlet.test.</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
"
`;

