exports[`message approveSignIn > matches its HTML and text snapshots > text 1`] = `
"Sign-in request

Someone entered the password of the Prismatica account ines@arlet.test and is waiting for your approval.

Time: Saturday, 17 October 2026 at 12:00:00 UTC
Browser and system: Mozilla/5.0 (X11 Linux x86_64) Firefox/131.0
Network address: 203.0.113.7
Place: Unknown location

Approve only if you are signing in right now and can see the 2-digit number on that screen. Never approve a sign-in you did not start.

Review this sign-in:
https://prismatica.example/auth/approve#t=abcDEF123_-abcDEF123_-abcDEF123_-abcDEF123_-

The page asks you to type the number before anything is approved. The request expires in 60 minutes.

This was not you? Do not open the link; the request expires on its own. Consider changing your password.

Prismatica - https://prismatica.example
"
`;

